OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to footballer after
OL,4,Adeath in Portugal
OL,5,
OL,6,FNon-league football teams that
OL,7,Fmidfielder Quevin Castro played for as
OL,8,Fhe progressed through the ranks have
OL,9,Fpaid tribute to him, after he collapsed
OL,10,Fand died during a match in Portugal.
OL,12,FThe 25-year-old was born in Portugal
OL,13,Fbut grew up in Thetford, Norfolk, and
OL,14,Fhe played for his local team as well as
OL,15,Fothers in Suffolk and in Cambridge,
OL,16,Fbefore signing for West Bromwich Albion
OL,17,Fin 2021.
OL,19,FCastro was playing for Real Sport Clube
OL,20,Fin a friendly against Estrela de
OL,21,FAmadora in Lisbon when the incident
OL,22,Fhappened on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
