OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to footballer after
OL,4,Adeath in Portugal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThetford Town FC chairman Nigel Armes,
OL,7,Fwho nurtured Castro's early career,
OL,8,Fremembered him as an "immensely
OL,9,Ftalented" teenager, and a boy to whom
OL,10,F"football was everything".
